  "application_type_full": "Full planning permission",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed conversion would result in the loss of a 3-bedroom family dwelling and fails to provide adequate compensatory family accommodation, leading to a net reduction in family housing within the borough. This outcome undermines the Council's strategic objective to increase the supply of larger (3+ bedroom) units, which are essential to meeting the housing needs of families. The proposal is therefore contrary to Section 5 of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy GG4 of the London Plan (2021), Policy CP5 of the Core Strategy (2010), Policies DMD4 and DMD5 of the Development Management Document (2014), and the Council's Strategic Housing Market Assessment (SHMA 2015).",
    "The proposal has failed to demonstrate sufficient measures to ensure that the development is safe from flooding, will not increase flood risk elsewhere and promotes Sustainable Drainage at the site. The proposal is therefore contrary to the NPPF (2024), Policies SI 12 and SI 13 of the London Plan (2021), CP21 and CP28 of Core Strategy (2010) and DMD 60, DMD 61 of the Development Management Document (2014)."
  ],
